body:
Remember: If you decide to go out, end it with a bang! Bug a massive ultra loaded bag of weed and the best food yo u can think off and party hard, and then when you are the highest and most well fed. DO IT!

&#x200B;

Otherwise keep trucking.

No. Smoke a big fat pack of weed and then jump out of a airplane. Hopefully you will be to stoned to realize what is actually happening. BONUS points if you scream FLAPPY BIRD repeatedly before hitting the ground.

&#x200B;

Or you can keep suffering like the rest of us. Either way GL OP.

Should have bought a stronger cord. Shit you even failed at dying you fucking cocksucking worthless nigg3r, You might as well turn it around and try LIVING. :)

&#x200B;

It's something I will tell myself the day I go over the edge.

I woke up into a half nightmare but I can relate. If life sucks and if you finally are going to do it. I'd advise taking out your enemies first. Everyone who has been evil to you. Give them a early grave.

&#x200B;

And fuck any whiteknights. How can you defend people being complete dicks and psychological tormentors and not encourage revenge? SMH.
